WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.397 --> 00:00:03.570
Unit six. Feelings and Opinions!

2
00:00:04.559 --> 00:00:09.591
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:09.641 --> 00:00:13.156
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.206 --> 00:00:17.542
Today we learn: Feelings and Opinions. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:22.937
Excited. Say it with me. Excited!

6
00:00:26.449 --> 00:00:30.699
Nervous. Say it with me. Nervous!

7
00:00:34.206 --> 00:00:37.640
Proud. Say it with me. Proud!

8
00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:45.014
Disappointed. Say it with me. Disappointed!

9
00:00:48.497 --> 00:00:51.831
Agree. Say it with me. Agree!

10
00:00:55.352 --> 00:00:59.702
Disagree. Say it with me. Disagree!

11
00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:07.024
Grateful. Say it with me. Grateful!

12
00:01:10.505 --> 00:01:14.072
Jealous. Say it with me. Jealous!

13
00:01:17.573 --> 00:01:21.739
Confused. Say it with me. Confused!

14
00:01:25.239 --> 00:01:28.972
Relieved. Say it with me. Relieved!

15
00:01:32.488 --> 00:01:36.138
Hopeful. Say it with me. Hopeful!

16
00:01:39.646 --> 00:01:43.330
Curious. Say it with me. Curious!

17
00:01:46.823 --> 00:01:56.513
Grammar time! I think  or  I agree. Listen. I think it is important. I agree with you.

18
00:01:56.563 --> 00:02:02.616
Your turn. Say it with me. I think it is important. I agree with you.

19
00:02:07.515 --> 00:02:14.250
I felt nervous before the test, but proud after I passed. I agree that studying helps us succeed.

20
00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.690
I like this story!

21
00:02:16.384 --> 00:02:21.829
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:21.879 --> 00:02:23.029
Proud!

23
00:02:24.146 --> 00:02:29.468
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:29.518 --> 00:02:30.668
Grateful!

25
00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:39.881
Think and answer. How do you feel before an important test?

26
00:02:39.931 --> 00:02:41.081
Great answer!

27
00:02:42.169 --> 00:02:45.335
This unit's value is Respectful Disagreement.

28
00:02:45.385 --> 00:02:47.723
I can show respectful disagreement every day!

29
00:02:48.407 --> 00:02:52.888
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

30
00:02:52.938 --> 00:02:54.548
Bye-bye, friends!

